# Diagram — explicit Mermaid read-mode pipeline flow
#
# Existing eval cases exercise table/list/section answers heavily, but
# most do not force the diagram contract. This case asks for a visual
# Mermaid flow so analyzer must emit a diagram_hint / DiagramContract,
# finalizer must produce a grounded diagram block, and the renderer must
# preserve the fenced diagram in the answer.
#
# Ground truth: the core read-mode pipeline stages are analyze →
# explore → extract → finalize. Conditional log/perf pre-stages may be
# mentioned, but they must not replace the four core stage nodes.
ID="qf_diagram_pipeline"
NAME="diagram — Mermaid read-mode pipeline flow"
QUESTION="请用 Mermaid 流程图画出 codrax read-mode pipeline 的 4 个主 stage，并在图后简要说明每个 stage 负责什么。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyze explore extract finalize"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX='(```mermaid|flowchart|graph[[:space:]]+(TD|LR))'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="Spring Django"
